Name: ART libdexfile and libartbase
URL: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/art
Version: N/A
Revision: ddd4776acaa0a4fb0e6027cd063ec450f518c7d7
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: Apache-2.0
License File: //third_party/libunwindstack/LICENSE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes

Description:
Two libraries of the Android Runtime: libdexfile parses dex files, and
libartbase holds the helpers it needs. libunwindstack uses libdexfile to
symbolize interpreted Java frames, and //third_party/libunwindstack
builds both into its libunwindstack target.

src/ holds the files BUILD.gn lists from the libdexfile/ and libartbase/
directories of the upstream repository, plus two headers they include
that BUILD.gn does not list: libartbase/base/unix_file/random_access_file.h
and libdexfile/dex/proto_reference.h. Patches 0001, 0008, 0009, 0010,
0011, 0012, 0014 and 0016 in patches/ change some of them. Chromium also
added #include lines to libartbase mem_map.cc and to libdexfile
compact_dex_file.cc, standard_dex_file.cc and dex_file_verifier.cc
without a patch (libunwindstack.git dcd4e94 and 0928ad0).

To update, copy those files at the new revision into src/, reapply the
changes above, and update Revision.
